 "sentences": [
  "This river travels 5.5 miles in 1.3 miles.",
  "Millions of years ago, the San Juan River flowed across a flat plain.",
  "Then, geologic forces pushed the Colorado Plateau upward.",
  "This increased the river's speed and erosive power.",
  "It carved deep, horseshoe-shaped bends called goosenecks into 300-million-year-old rock.",
  "Today, the canyon is 1,000 feet deep.",
  "This remote spot is also a certified International Dark Sky Park."
